Z||000005||Tigger||12-03-2001||04:24 PM||||If it's rust free, overall decent shape and runs good, buy it.  If you don't, let me know about it so I can buy it and put another together.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Even if you end up using it for parts it's gotta be worth at least $200 especially if it turns out to be an Indy.<P>------------------<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tiggerblue4.gif">         <BR>T-T-F-N, Ta Ta For Now!<BR><A HREF="http://www.envy.nu/fiero/" TARGET=_blank>Tigger's Fiero Page</A>||||reg||1
